    "source_file": "BScene.res",
    "source_member": "WarInMiddleEarth/data/Disk.2",
    "text": "From the south in the Land of Mordor, there rose a\nhuge shape of shadow, black against the pall of cloud,\nimpenetrable, lightning-crowned, filling all the sky.\nEnormous it reared above the world, on its hand a band\nof utter darkness, dooming the land to night eternal.\n         YOU HAVE LOST THE WAR IN MIDDLE EARTH.",
    "type": "CSTR",
