    "source_file": "BScene.res",
    "source_member": "WarInMiddleEarth/data/Disk.2",
    "text": "Suddenly the earth groaned and quaked! Rising\nswiftly up, high above the mountains, a vast\nsoaring darkness sprang into the sky, flickering\nwith fire. From far away, now dim, now growing,\nnow mounting to the clouds, there came a rumble,\na roar, a long echoing roll of ruinous noise.",
