    "source_member": "WarInMiddleEarth/data/Disk.2",
    "text": "'The realm of Sauron is ended!' said Gandalf.\n'The Ring-bearer has fulfilled his Quest.' And as\nall gazed south to the Land of Mordor it seemed\nto them that, black against the pall of cloud,\nthere rose a huge shape of shadow, impenetrable,\nlightning-crowned, filling all the sky.",
