    "source_file": "BScene.res",
    "source_member": "WarInMiddleEarth/data/Disk.2",
    "text": "Dear Frodo,\nBad news has reached me here. I must go off, I will return as\nsoon as I can. Leave at once for Rivendell. There I hope we may\nmeet again. You may meet a friend of mine on the Road: a Man,\nby some called Strider. He will help you.\nYours in haste\nGANDALF.\nPS. The servants of the Enemy are abroad and have taken\nthe guise of riders in black. Avoid them at all cost!",
